---

Note on the audio and telemetry this project analyses.

The team-radio clips come from the `MikCil/f1-team-radio` dataset on the Hugging
Face Hub and are not redistributed here - `backend/clips/` is gitignored, and
the build fetches them from the Hub. Lap and stint telemetry comes from FastF1,
which sources it from the Formula 1 live timing service. Formula 1, F1 and
related marks belong to Formula One Licensing BV. This is an independent
research project and is not associated with or endorsed by Formula 1.

The MIT grant above covers this repository's own code and the derived analysis
in `backend/races/`. It does not grant rights to the underlying audio.
